a29a-4dad-a9da-155882391815","published_at":"2021-06-18","source":"wotc"},{"comment":"The basic land types are Plains, Island, Swamp, Mountain, and Forest. Land types other than basic land types (such as Desert) don't contribute to domain abilities.","oracle_id":"fd547632-a29a-4dad-a9da-155882391815","published_at":"2021-06-18","source":"wotc"}],"schema_version":1,"source":"Scryfall Oracle/rulings subset for offline tests"}
